+Files created/modified
+
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/mod.rs`
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/existence.rs`
+- Created `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/schema.sql`
