+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/lib.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/memory/model.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/memory/store.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/retrieval_v1/scoring_support.rs`
+- Modified `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-architecture.md`
+
+Verification commands and outputs
+
+- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/mod.rs`
+  - Exit status: `0`
+  - Output:
+    ```text
+    OK
+    ```
+- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/verification/existence.rs`
+  - Exit status: `0`
+  - Output:
+    ```text
+    OK
+    ```
+- `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib verification::existence_tests`
+  - Exit status: `0`
+  - Output:
+    ```text
+       Finished `test` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 13.41s
+        Running unittests src/lib.rs (target/debug/deps/lattice_core-641ea4bda0b91c0b)
+
+    running 6 tests
+    test verification::existence_tests::verification_schema_round_trips_under_runtime_migration ... ok
+    test verification::existence_tests::deleted_test_emits_invalidated_proposal ... ok
+    test verification::existence_tests::existing_doc_section_emits_verified_proposal ... ok
+    test verification::existence_tests::deleted_symbol_emits_invalidated_proposal ... ok
+    test verification::existence_tests::live_file_evidence_emits_verified_proposal ... ok
+    test verification::existence_tests::deleting_file_emits_invalidated_proposal ... ok
+
+    test result: ok. 6 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 469 filtered out; finished in 0.47s
+    ```
+
+Issues encountered
+
+- The workspace graph index was unavailable through the Lattice workflow tools during discovery, so implementation inspection fell back to direct repo reads.
+- Extending legacy `MemoryVerificationStatus` with `expired` and `invalidated` surfaced an existing retrieval scorer exhaustiveness gap; `retrieval_v1/scoring_support.rs` was updated so the new statuses are penalized consistently instead of failing compilation.
+- The first verifier pass treated an empty file index as “no evidence checked” for deleted-file coverage and treated doc-section verification too indirectly through the resolver. Both cases were corrected so file deletion yields `MarkInvalidated` and doc-section evidence verifies deterministically from parsed markdown sections.
+
+Final status: complete

