+
+Issues encountered
+
+- The workspace graph index was unavailable through the Lattice workflow tools during discovery, so implementation inspection fell back to direct repo reads.
+- Extending legacy `MemoryVerificationStatus` with `expired` and `invalidated` surfaced an existing retrieval scorer exhaustiveness gap; `retrieval_v1/scoring_support.rs` was updated so the new statuses are penalized consistently instead of failing compilation.
+- The first verifier pass treated an empty file index as “no evidence checked” for deleted-file coverage and treated doc-section verification too indirectly through the resolver. Both cases were corrected so file deletion yields `MarkInvalidated` and doc-section evidence verifies deterministically from parsed markdown sections.
+
